 "blocksHtml": "<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/670edb29a0c5.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1314\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm mb-1@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nIsolation Reflections\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA conceptual visual series, created during the global COVID pandemic. These dreamy, surreal images aimed to capture the simple things we missed during periods of self isolation, providing a small moment of relaxed escapism for the viewer.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/bef3bf4ffe03.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1327\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/25f99a1dede5.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1319\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/faee69fbcbbc.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1317\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-7/12@sm offset-2/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm mb-1@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nOvergrown\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-6/12@sm offset-2/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA surreal visualisation series, exploring the integration of nature with interiors and architectural spaces.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11746aaa7c9c43dd7\" src=\"/media/dee3f71deef4.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11756aaa7c9c44398\" src=\"/media/fe27be27eeaf.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11766aaa7c9c447dd\" src=\"/media/82da3040fa29.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-8/12@sm offset-2/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm mb-1@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nPoolsides\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-7/12@sm offset-2/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA collaborative project with Interior Designer and Artist, Charlotte Taylor. The core idea behind the collaboration was to visualise unique poolside destinations, some of which are inspired by real locations and others being slightly more surreal.<br/>\n<br/>\nThe project gained huge attention online, being shared by numerous design platforms. We also had the honour of one of the images being used as an Architectural Digest magazine cover.<br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image22206aaa7c9c4eccd\" src=\"/media/30aa7b14834c.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image14286aaa7c9c4f597\" src=\"/media/3d17e0667c14.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/648b7c805c8d.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1429\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image14306aaa7c9c58ef4\" src=\"/media/87e81babfda2.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n(Really) Remote Working\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nAnother image series born out of the desire to escape the confines of lockdown. The visuals are a jovial view on what remote working might look like in the future, by placing work stations in dream locations — the ideal workcation!\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image23846aaa7c9c5dd8b\" src=\"/media/06a7e7ab263a.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image14026aaa7c9c5e099\" src=\"/media/eea475eb3cee.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image23866aaa7c9c67152\" src=\"/media/0da45e04f712.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-8/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11796aaa7c9c67570\" src=\"/media/c98433e7e2e5.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/3a210c6b3b60.m4v\" dom2webgl=\"image1408\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/d2a97eb9bce1.m4v\" dom2webgl=\"image1182\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-8/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image23876aaa7c9c6861a\" src=\"/media/ca16e40b6a71.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image23886aaa7c9c68af9\" src=\"/media/704d86a0d7df.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-10/12 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image23896aaa7c9c68e45\" src=\"/media/c2fbc940bfc9.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl